# Kanto's Champion battle (FireRed's MUS_VS_CHAMPION): a count-in climbing an E minor arpeggio, then a trumpet theme that
# rises and falls over hammering brass chords, a running piano and a dominant that keeps coming back, for the last battle
# of the League. Original composition for this game (plan 19 · K8).
